# The source archive is evidence, but it is also every PDF every distributor has
# ever published. DPDC alone republishes 36 files at a time, so committing it
# would add hundreds of megabytes a year for no benefit: each published claim
# already carries the source_url and the SHA-256 of the exact bytes we read, so
# provenance survives without the blobs. Kept locally and in the CI workspace.
data/seed/archive/
build/
